2025-12-04 10:59:35 [grok-code-1] for custom graphics or annotations), then feed it through a normal thermal printer head (e.g., 58mm
2025-12-04 10:59:35 [grok-code-1] module) to add heat-activated text/images on top. The thermal head would "develop" the pre-drawn
2025-12-04 10:59:35 [grok-code-1] areas or overlay new content.
