2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] Pico Plotter Construction Guide (Outline for 1520:6):
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 1. Assemble Frame: Mount PCB and standoffs on base plate. Attach motors/servos to sides.
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 2. X-Axis: Install GT2 belt/pulley on gearmotor; connect carriage with pen holder.
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 3. Y-Axis: Attach feed roller to Y motor; add endstops.
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 4. Wiring: Connect motors to drivers (DRV8833), servo/ switches to GPIO per allocation.
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 5. Software: Flash RP2040 with PIO stepper code + G-code parser.
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 6. Test: Home axes, plot simple lines; calibrate for accuracy.
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 7. Shell: Snap on 3D-printed cosmetic cover (holiday theme).
2025-12-04 11:01:33 [grok-code-1] 
