2025-12-04 14:24:18 [grok-code-1] pixels (~51 Mbps) exceeds that. For your 2-bit monochrome project (2 bits/pixel = ~6.4 Mbps), it's
2025-12-04 14:24:18 [grok-code-1] plenty. If aiming for 16-bit color, consider frame buffering, lower resolution/frame rate, or
2025-12-04 14:24:18 [grok-code-1] SPI/I2C to another device for output. Compression or PIO-optimized sampling could help too. What's
