2025-12-04 16:05:24 [nitro@ryzen5] what was VIC-1902?
2025-12-04 16:05:29 [grok-code-1] VIC-1902 was the model number for "Star Battle", a Galaxian-style fixed shooter game released by
2025-12-04 16:05:29 [grok-code-1] Commodore for the VIC-20 in 1981. It featured scrolling alien formations and was part of
2025-12-04 16:05:29 [grok-code-1] Commodore's early cartridge lineup.
