2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] provides excellent context for Commodore's evolution into computers.
2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  VIC-20 Library: The "First Party Entertainment" section is particularly detailed
2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] regarding the VIC-19xx series cartridges, which are often overshadowed by the C64 library in other
2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] datasets.
