2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] noting the Kanji titles, `yen` pricing, and publishers like HAL Laboratory, which historically had
2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] close ties with Commodore Japan.
2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] 4.  Structure: The data is well-structured with consistent key-value pairs, making it easy
2025-12-05 11:16:17 [gemini-3-pro] to parse for a frontend catalog or database import.
