2025-12-05 16:17:09 [nitro@ryzen5] panel mount looks preferrable, can you describe
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] • Panel Mount Edge Connector* for SX-64:6:
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] • Advantages:*
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Secure mounting to case front panel
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Strain relief - takes insertion force off PCB
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Professional appearance - flush with case
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Easy assembly - connector mounts separately from PCB
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] • Typical Features:*
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] Mounting: Screws or clips to panel front
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] Orientation: Vertical (cartridge inserts downward)
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] Bezel: Flush or slightly recessed
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] Retention: Friction fit or optional latch
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] Access: Front-loading (user accessible)
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] • Mechanical Design:*
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 1. Front Panel Cutout: Precise rectangle for connector body
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 2. Mounting Holes: 2-4 screw points around connector
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 3. PCB Connection: Ribbon cable or right-angle header to internal board
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 4. Alignment: Guides to ensure cartridge inserts straight
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] • For SX-64:6:*
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Panel thickness: ~2-3mm (acrylic or aluminum)
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Cutout size: ~60×15mm (for 44-pin connector)
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Mounting: Small M2 screws from inside
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Aesthetic: Black connector against beige case
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] • Alternative: PCB-mounted with reinforcement*
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Connector on daughterboard
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - Daughterboard screws to case
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] - More compact but less robust
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] • Panel mount gives that authentic "console" feel* - cartridge slots firmly into the case
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] itself.
2025-12-05 16:17:24 [deepseek-chat] 
