2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] Why Touch for a Luggable:
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - Authentic UI: Touchscreen mimics modern laptop/tablet interaction
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - Space-saving: Eliminates need for miniature keyboard/mouse
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - Versatile: Can display virtual controls, menus, status
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - Retro-futuristic: Combines classic design with modern interface
