2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] 1.28-inch Touch Display Module (19804) Implementation:
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] • Dual Protocol Setup:*
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] Display (SPI):
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - CS   (Chip Select)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - DC   (Data/Command)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - SCLK (Clock)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - MOSI (Data Out)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - RST  (Reset)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - BL   (Backlight)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] Touch (I2C):
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - SDA  (I2C Data)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - SCL  (I2C Clock)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] - INT  (Interrupt - optional)
2025-12-05 23:58:49 [deepseek-chat] 
