2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] - Material: Black plastic with NeXT logo
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] - Feet: Rubber feet for stability
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] Display Integration:
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] The 63mm display cube sits directly on the 50mm pizza box - this creates a stepped look
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] that's actually quite authentic to how the MegaPixel display sat on the NeXTstation.
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] sku: NeXTstation:6 (Pizza Box Edition)
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] - CPU unit: 50×50×12mm pizza box
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] - Display: 63×63×63mm with 2.8" touch
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] - Complete footprint: 80mm × 100mm desk space
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] This maintains the NeXTstation identity (pizza box) while giving you enough height for the
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] RP2040 and Luma2 circuitry. The 12mm height is challenging but doable with surface-mount components
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] and careful PCB design.
2025-12-06 00:28:20 [deepseek-chat] 
