2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] Excellent thinking! 52×52mm gives you perfect side-by-side RP2040 stacking. Here's the
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] optimized design:
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
