2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] ┌─────────────────────┐
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] │  RP2040  │  RP2040  │ 26mm each
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] │  Stack 1 │  Stack 2 │
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] │          │          │
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] │ Luma2    │ Power/   │
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] │ Circuit  │ SD Card  │
