2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] Two RP2040 Stacks:
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] • Stack 1 (Left 26×52mm):*
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - RP2040 Pico (21×51mm)
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Luma2 circuit (4× LM319 + trimpots)
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Composite RCA input
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] • Stack 2 (Right 26×52mm):*
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - RP2040 Pico (21×51mm) or Pico W for WiFi
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - MicroSD card reader
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - USB-C power management
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Status LEDs
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] Height Management (12mm):
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - RP2040: 21mm × 51mm × ? (Pico is ~4mm tall)
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Stacked PCBs: 1.6mm each × 3 layers = 4.8mm
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Components: Surface-mount to stay under 12mm
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Spacers: 6mm standoffs between boards
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] Layer Stack (Bottom to Top):
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 1. Bottom PCB: Power distribution, USB-C, RCA ports
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 2. Middle PCB: RP2040 #1 + Luma2 circuit
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 3. Top PCB: RP2040 #2 + MicroSD + touch interface
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 4. Top cover: Ventilated with NeXT logo
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] Port Placement:
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
