2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] │ │ │S│ │
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] │ │ │D│ │
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] └─┴─┴─┴─┘
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] USB-C | RCA | MicroSD | 3.5mm audio
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] Dual RP2040 Advantage:
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 1. Dedicated processors:
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat]    - RP2040 #1: Video capture (Luma2) + NeXT UI
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat]    - RP2040 #2: Touch interface + file system + networking
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 2. Parallel processing: Real-time video + responsive UI
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 3. Failover: One can reboot without losing functionality
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 4. Pico W option: WiFi for web browser homage
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] Inter-processor Communication:
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - UART: Simple serial between processors
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Shared GPIO: For synchronization
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - MicroSD: Shared filesystem
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - I2C: Optional for tighter coupling
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 52×52mm Benefits:
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Perfect square: Matches NeXT aesthetic
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Display sits centered: 63mm display on 52mm base
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Room for ports: All connectors fit on back
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] - Manufacturing: Standard PCB size
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] This gives you a professional, over-engineered NeXTstation replica that's actually more
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] capable than the original in some ways! The dual RP2040 setup is authentic to the "workstation"
2025-12-06 00:30:23 [deepseek-chat] concept.
