2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 4-High Benefits:
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 1. Dedicated processors: Each RP2040 has specific role
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 2. Thermal separation: Heat doesn't accumulate
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 3. Serviceability: Can remove/replace individual layers
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 4. Expandability: Add more layers in future
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 5. Aesthetic: True to "cube" concept with internal complexity
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] Possible 4-Processor Architecture:
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 1. RP2040 #1: NeXTSTEP UI & application layer
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 2. RP2040 #2: Video capture & processing (Luma2)
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 3. RP2040 #3: File system & network services
2025-12-06 00:35:59 [deepseek-chat] 4. RP2040 #4: Touch interface & display driver
