2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] 1. Top cover (2mm) with ventilation
2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] 2. Interface PCB (1.6mm) + components (4mm)
2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] 3. Spacer (6mm) for airflow
2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] 4. Dual Pico PCB (1.6mm) + components (8mm)
2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] 5. Spacer (4mm)
2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] 6. Base PCB (1.6mm) + ports/components (6mm)
2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] 7. Bottom cover (1mm)
2025-12-06 00:49:30 [deepseek-chat] Total: 24mm
