2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] Processing Power:
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - 4× RP2040 = 4 × 133 MHz = 532 MHz aggregate
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - 8× Cores (dual-core each) = 8-core system
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - 32× PWM channels (8 each)
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - 16× ADC channels (4 each)
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - 8× UARTs, 8× SPI, 8× I2C interfaces
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] Communication Between Processors:
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 1. Shared GPIO bus in center
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 2. UART cross-connections (each to each)
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 3. I2C multi-master bus
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 4. Shared memory via external PSRAM
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 5. Message passing via dedicated pins
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] Possible Configurations:
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] • A. Symmetric Multiprocessing:*
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - All 4 run same code on different data
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Load balancing across processors
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] • B. Pipeline Processing:*
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Pico1: Input capture (Luma2 video)
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Pico2: Processing/compression
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Pico3: Storage/network
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Pico4: Output/display
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] • C. Redundant Processing:*
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - 2× primary, 2× backup
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Fault-tolerant system
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] sku: QuadPico-24
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Dimensions: 52×52×24mm pizza box
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Processors: 4× RP2040 Picos
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Ports: 4× USB-C + power + expansion
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Performance: 8-core, 532 MHz
2025-12-06 00:51:53 [deepseek-chat] - Use: Parallel computing, video processing, emulation
