2025-12-06 00:55:01 [nitro@ryzen5] just the circuit and a standard connector to the external lipo cel
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] Perfect! Internal LIPO management circuit + standard connector to external cell is the
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] cleanest approach. Here's the design:
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] Internal LIPO Management Circuit
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] Circuit Components:
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] Required:
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 1. TP4056 (or similar) LIPO charger IC
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 2. DW01A (or similar) protection IC
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 3. FS312F (or similar) protection MOSFET
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 4. 5V boost converter (MT3608 or similar)
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 5. 3.3V LDO regulator (AMS1117 or similar)
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 6. JST-PH 2-pin connector (standard LIPO)
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] Schematic Overview:
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 
