2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat]   ↓
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] [Protection Circuit] DW01A+FS312F →
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat]   ↓
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] [Charging Circuit] TP4056 ← USB-C 5V IN
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat]   ↓
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] 3.7V LIPO (protected) →
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat]   ↓
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] [Boost Converter] → 5V system bus →
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat]   ↓
2025-12-06 00:55:42 [deepseek-chat] [3.3V LDO] → 3.3V logic bus
