2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] Series configuration:
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] Cell1(+)→Cell2(+)→Cell3(+)→Cell4(+)→Output
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat]    ↓        ↓        ↓        ↓
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat]   GND      GND      GND      GND
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] Advantages: Higher voltage, efficient buck conversion
