2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] • Option B: 2S2P (7.4V nominal)*
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] Series-parallel:
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] (Cell1∥Cell2) → (Cell3∥Cell4) → Output
2025-12-06 00:59:31 [deepseek-chat] Advantages: Balance charging simpler, more current
