2025-12-06 08:14:31 [grok-code-1] waste. Each piece will fit within the 1610 Pro's ~160mm x 100mm work area for engraving. Ensure
2025-12-06 08:14:31 [grok-code-1] your cutting method accounts for kerf.
2025-12-06 08:14:31 [grok-code-1] 
2025-12-06 08:23:55 [nitro@ryzen5] with 1610 Pro CNC Laser Engraver DIY Mini Router 3 Axis PCB PVC Milling Machine Wood Router Machine GRBL Controller touch offline what laser should i use for engraving and what can i use for cutting?
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] The 1610 Pro is primarily a CNC milling machine but supports laser modules for engraving.
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] 
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] - Engraving: Use a 5W-10W blue diode laser module (e.g., 450nm wavelength) for precise PCB
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] marking or wood burning. Ensure GRBL firmware supports PWM for power control.
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] 
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] - Cutting: For PCBs, use the spindle with 0.8-1.0mm carbide V-bits or end mills for milling
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] traces/isolation. For thin plastics/wood, a higher-power laser (20W+ CO2 or fiber) could work, but
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] upgrade the machine if needed—standard 1610 lasers are weak for cutting. Always check material
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] thickness and safety.
2025-12-06 08:24:02 [grok-code-1] 
2025-12-06 08:24:28 [nitro@ryzen5] options are 2.5W to 20W
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] For the 1610 Pro:
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] 
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] - 2.5W: Good for light engraving on PCBs, wood, or acrylic—inexpensive and sufficient for
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] basic marking.
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] - 5W-10W: Better for deeper, faster engraving on similar materials; ideal for most DIY
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] projects.
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] - 20W: Overkill for engraving unless you need high-speed or thicker materials; increases
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] heat and requires better cooling.
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] 
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] Start with 5W for balance of cost and performance. Ensure the laser module fits the machine's
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] mount.
2025-12-06 08:24:31 [grok-code-1] 
