2025-12-06 08:26:01 [grok-code-1] spiral bits in various sizes like 0.1-1.0mm). Common for CNC machines like the 1610 Pro, used for
2025-12-06 08:26:01 [grok-code-1] engraving/milling traces on PCBs. Prices vary, but expect $10-30 for a basic set. If you mean
