2025-12-06 08:27:22 [nitro@ryzen5] what is ER11?
2025-12-06 08:27:25 [grok-code-1] ER11 is a type of collet chuck system used in CNC spindles (like on the 1610 Pro). It securely
2025-12-06 08:27:25 [grok-code-1] holds cutting tools (end mills, drills) with shaft diameters from ~1mm to 7mm. It's standard for
2025-12-06 08:27:26 [grok-code-1] small desktop CNCs—inexpensive, precise, and easy to change tools. If you're buying cutters, ensure
2025-12-06 08:27:26 [grok-code-1] they're compatible with ER11.
2025-12-06 08:27:26 [grok-code-1] 
