2025-12-07 09:23:28 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-07 09:23:28 [gemini-3-pro] POKE 1024, 160   :REM Puts solid block char at top-left
2025-12-07 09:23:28 [gemini-3-pro] POKE 55296, 1    :REM Sets that position's color to White
2025-12-07 09:23:28 [gemini-3-pro] 
