2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] • PET 2001 (1977): This was the original model featuring a 9-inch screen, a small "chiclet"
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] keyboard, and a built-in cassette recorder.
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] • CBM 4016 (1980): This was a later revision intended for business use. It featured a
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] larger 12-inch screen, a full-stroke typewriter-style keyboard, no built-in cassette, and upgraded
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] BASIC 4.0.
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] Regarding the timeline, the CBM 4016 was released slightly before the VIC-20.
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] • CBM 4000 Series: Introduced in May 1980.
2025-12-07 17:10:40 [gemini-3-pro] • VIC-20: Released in Japan in June 1980 and in North America in 1981.
