2025-12-08 08:00:24 [kimi-k2-0905] It’s the Deno equivalent of Node’s
2025-12-08 08:00:24 [kimi-k2-0905] `if (require.main === module)` – the block runs only when the file is executed directly (e.g. `deno
2025-12-08 08:00:24 [kimi-k2-0905] run file.ts`), not when it is imported as a module.
