2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] ## C-64 MEMORY MAP (simplified, KERNAL view)
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $0000-$00FF   zero-page
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $0100-$01FF   CPU stack
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $0200-$02FF   KERNAL vector tables / cassette buffer
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $0300-$03FF   BASIC vector tables
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $0400-$07FF   screen-RAM (25×40 = 1000 bytes)
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $0800-$9FFF   BASIC program area
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $A000-$BFFF   BASIC ROM (can be RAM if bit 1 $01 = 0)
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $C000-$CFFF   free RAM
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] $D000-$DFFF   I/O & colour-RAM & ROM
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905]               $D000-$D02E   VIC-II registers
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905]               $D400-$D7FF   SID
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905]               $D800-$DBFF   colour-RAM (nybbles)
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905]               $DC00-$DCFF   CIA#1
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905]               $DD00-$DDFF   CIA#2
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905]               $E000-$FFFF   KERNAL ROM / cartridge ROM
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905]               $10000-$1FFFF  REU (if present)
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] ## I/O quick references
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] 53272   $D018   CHBAS / CHARGEN base address (VIC-II)
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] 64738   $FCE2   cold-reset entry (SYS 64738 → RESET)
2025-12-08 10:30:55 [kimi-k2-0905] 
