2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] 7 6 5   4   3   2 1 0
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] xscroll2 xscroll1 xscroll0  40col  res  unused unused unused
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] - bits 7-5: fine X-scroll (0-7 pixels)
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] - bit 4: 40-column flag (1=40 cols, 0=38 cols)
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] - bit 3: reserved (always write 0)
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] - bits 2-0: unused (ignored)
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-08 10:46:22 [kimi-k2-0905] Only one 3-bit xscroll field—your duplicate was a typo.
