2025-12-08 11:46:59 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:46:59 [gemini-3-pro] • Shift maps to the Shift key.
2025-12-08 11:46:59 [gemini-3-pro] • Commodore (C=) maps to the left Control (Ctrl) key.
