2025-12-08 11:49:45 [nitro@ryzen5] load dir device 8
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] Hello.
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] • C64 Charsets*
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] The C64 has two character sets. The one with lowercase letters is called
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] Lowercase/Uppercase mode. The default startup mode is Uppercase/Graphics.
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] • VICE Keyboard Mapping*
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] By default, the mapping in VICE is:
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Commodore Key: Left Control
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Shift: Shift
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] To toggle the charset, press Shift + Left Control.
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Loading Directory*
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] To load the directory from device 8:
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] LOAD "$",8
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] Type `LIST` afterwards to view the files.
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Switching Case via Command*
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] If the keyboard toggle is not working, you can switch to Lowercase/Uppercase mode by typing this
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] command:
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] PRINT CHR$(14)
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:19 [nitro@ryzen5] file not found
2025-12-08 11:50:32 [gemini-3-pro] The lower case character set is the Lowercase/Uppercase mode of PETSCII.
2025-12-08 11:50:32 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 11:50:32 [gemini-3-pro] In the VICE emulator, the Commodore key is typically mapped to the Left Control key on your
2025-12-08 11:50:32 [gemini-3-pro] PC keyboard. To switch character sets, press Shift + Left Control.
2025-12-08 11:50:32 [gemini-3-pro] 
