2025-12-08 12:06:42 [gemini-3-pro] Here are the named functions to retrieve a file extension and read a file as bytes using Deno and
2025-12-08 12:06:42 [gemini-3-pro] the standard library.
2025-12-08 12:06:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 12:06:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 12:06:42 [gemini-3-pro] import { extname, join } from "https://deno.land/std@0.224.0/path/mod.ts";
2025-12-08 12:06:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-08 12:06:42 [gemini-3-pro] function getFileExtension(pathString) {
