2025-12-08 16:54:54 [kimi-k2-0905] prints “hello world!” when run.  you can now extend the switch statement for remaining instructions
2025-12-08 16:54:54 [kimi-k2-0905] and addressing modes (sty, cmp, branches, etc.) without touching the rest of petsync.
