2025-12-08 19:13:37 [kimi-k2-0905] header is still wrong.
2025-12-08 19:13:37 [kimi-k2-0905] C64 BASIC expects the next-line pointer first, then the line number, then the payload, and
2025-12-08 19:13:37 [kimi-k2-0905] the whole thing must start at $0801.
2025-12-08 19:13:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-08 19:13:37 [kimi-k2-0905] petsync.ts – tiny tweaks to make the stub load:
