2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] What bytes encode the line number
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Line 10: 0A 00 (little-endian)
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Line 100: 64 00
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Line 256: 00 01
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] 
