2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Line header: line number bytes = 0A 00
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Line content (after the line number in PRG): SYS token (158), space (32), digits '6','4','8'
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] (0x36, 0x34, 0x38), end-of-line (0)
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Full lineBytes portion (after the line pointer two-bytes): 158, 32, 0x36, 0x34, 0x38, 0
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] 
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] Example: a line "100 SYS 1234"
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Line header: line number bytes = 64 00
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - Line content: 158, 32, '1','2','3','4' (0x31,0x32,0x33,0x34), end-of-line (0)
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] - LineBytes: 158, 32, 0x31, 0x32, 0x33, 0x34, 0
2025-12-09 06:32:09 [gpt-5-nano] 
