2025-12-09 06:40:40 [gpt-5-nano] What to do
2025-12-09 06:40:40 [gpt-5-nano] - Ensure PRG header is present (load address 0x0801 -> bytes 01 08).
2025-12-09 06:40:40 [gpt-5-nano] - Then in BASIC type: SYS 2049 to jump to 0x0801 and run until RTS.
2025-12-09 06:40:40 [gpt-5-nano] - The code prints "HELLO" followed by a CR, then RTS returns to BASIC.
2025-12-09 06:40:40 [gpt-5-nano] 
