2025-12-10 09:50:45 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-10 09:50:45 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-10 09:50:45 [kimi-k2-0905] 10 OPEN2,2,3,CHR$(10)+CHR$(0)   :rem 10=38400
2025-12-10 09:50:45 [kimi-k2-0905] 20 PRINT#2,"HELLO WORLD"
2025-12-10 09:50:45 [kimi-k2-0905] 30 CLOSE2
