2025-12-11 20:30:08 [kimi-k2-0905] LCD. The markdown covers hardware BOM, GPIO allocation, netlist, and optional audio/chroma/5-grey
2025-12-11 20:30:08 [kimi-k2-0905] mods. Let me know if you need code, schematic checks, or help with the PIO program.
