2025-12-12 13:16:20 [kimi-k2-0905] executable.
2025-12-12 13:16:20 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-12 13:16:20 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-12 13:16:20 [kimi-k2-0905] cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.12)
