2025-12-12 17:54:15 [deepseek-chat] - Width: ~12.6 inches (32 cm)
2025-12-12 17:54:15 [deepseek-chat] - Height: ~11.8 inches (30 cm)
2025-12-12 17:54:15 [deepseek-chat] - Depth: ~14.2 inches (36 cm)
2025-12-12 17:54:15 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-12 17:54:15 [deepseek-chat] The screen’s active area was approximately 10.2 × 7.7 inches (260 × 195 mm), corresponding
2025-12-12 17:54:15 [deepseek-chat] to the 4:3 aspect ratio of the C64’s 320×200 pixel display.
