2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] PIO source (count_edges.pio)
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] .program count_edges
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] .side_set 1 opt
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] ; One state machine, one pin used as input
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] ; Every edge increments the OSR (which is shifted left)
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] ; When OSR fills (32 bits) we push it to RX FIFO and restart
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] start:
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905]     wait 0 pin 0        side 0   ; wait for low
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905]     wait 1 pin 0        side 1   ; wait for rising edge → increment
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905]     in  null,  1                 ; shift a 1 into ISR
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905]     jmp start
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] Assemble with
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] `pioasm countedges.pio countedges.pio.h`
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:29:25 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
