2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] cd sdk
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] git -C lib/tinyusb submodule update --init
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. Build pioasm locally
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
