2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] cmake -S . -B build -G "MinGW Makefiles"
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] cmake --build build --target pioasm
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] Executable lands in
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] `C:\toolchains\picoin\sdk\tools\build\pioasm\pioasm.exe`
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. Optional convenience wrapper (same folder)
