2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] Save as `C:\toolchains\picoin\pioasm.bat`; put
2025-12-20 12:39:57 [kimi-k2-0905] `C:\toolchains\picoin` on PATH if you want global access.
