2025-12-20 15:40:40 [grok-code-1] (immediate values 0-31 are allowed). It's the standard way—`add dest, src` works for registers or
2025-12-20 15:40:40 [grok-code-1] immediates. If your assembler rejects it, ensure you're using the latest pioasm and RP2040 target.
