2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] 
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] 
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] Why `+ machineIndex`?
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] 
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] SM0: RXFULL = bit 8, RXEMPTY = bit 12
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] SM1: RXFULL = bit 9, RXEMPTY = bit 13
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] SM2: RXFULL = bit 10, RXEMPTY = bit 14
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] SM3: RXFULL = bit 11, RXEMPTY = bit 15
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] 
