2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] • `pio->fstat & FullBit` = "Is my* SM's RX FIFO full?"
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] 
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] Clearing sticky bits:
2025-12-21 11:15:20 [grok-4-1] 
