2025-12-21 12:30:59 [grok-4-1] ├── PIO_FIFO_JOIN_NONE
2025-12-21 12:30:59 [grok-4-1] ├── PIO_FIFO_JOIN_RX      ← SM0 RX → SM1 TX
2025-12-21 12:30:59 [grok-4-1] └── PIO_FIFO_JOIN_TX      ← SM1 RX → SM0 TX
