2025-12-21 22:24:02 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-21 22:24:02 [gemini-3-pro] You generally do not need `smconfigsetinshift` for this specific logic because you
2025-12-21 22:24:02 [gemini-3-pro] are populating the ISR using `mov` (whole word) rather than shifting bits in via `in`. However,
