2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] 	int dma_chan = dma_claim_unused_channel(true);
2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] 	dma_channel_config c = dma_channel_get_default_config(dma_chan);
2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] 
