2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] 	channel_config_set_read_increment(&c, false);
2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] 	channel_config_set_write_increment(&c, false);
2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] 
