2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] Note on `luma2sample.pio`
2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] If `luma2sample` is intended to pass the data it pulled straight through to its own output FIFO (to
2025-12-21 22:48:45 [gemini-3-pro] be read by `readLuma2`), you need to move the data from the OSR (where `pull` puts it) to the ISR
